{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ANNA &amp; EMMA</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the\u00a0Paper Adventure  of Anna &amp; Emma:\u00a0 a cosy puzzle game designed for kids and parents to enjoy together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Emma and her little sister Anna as they wander through a colorful worlds, where every 2D character is lovingly hand-drawn. It\u2019s a charming mix of paper cut-outs and playful 3D worlds that feels like stepping into a storybook brought to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve puzzles, discover hidden paths, and meet quirky creatures - all while working together in local co-op. Whether you\u2019re a parent looking for a safe and creative digital activity to share with your child, or just someone who loves cosy puzzle games, Anna &amp; Emma offers a warm space for teamwork and discovery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >K<strong>ey Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Local co-op fun</strong> \u2013 Designed for two players, perfect for parents and kids playing side by side.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hand-drawn characters</strong> \u2013 Anna, Emma, and their friends are physically handcrafted.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Low-poly wonderland</strong> \u2013 Explore a playful environments full of surprises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzles</strong> \u2013 Simple and intuitive challenges that encourage collaboration and creativity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cosy atmosphere</strong> \u2013 Relax with cheerful music and soft ambient sounds of the forest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Made for togetherness</strong> \u2013 A game that encourages shared playtime instead of solo screen time.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4059790?t=1759155681","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai